{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別眾法附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "捨戒六念法附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受日法附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "功德衣法附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "房舍等五行調度眾具法附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "造立像寺法附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四儀法附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂出世正業等比丘所依"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是標宗。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是顯德。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別眾法附。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云：「就中相隱難知者」以下。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「眾取威儀，不用心順」\n者是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「上明攝法分齊，即須明非\n相。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此門細分有七，始從廿□下一人也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文中分門不次，"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「今明結法」者是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「羯磨者言」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「上座如常」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「言滅擯者」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「二者威儀之形」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「《四分》云：不得著俗人裩袴」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "捨戒六念法附。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「次令發戒」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「上已略明雜相，今正出眾\n問」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此中和上與依止合明。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "「上座白僧」。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受日法附。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云正加法。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "迦絺那衣法附。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此門移在四人法前明也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下諸戒，且隨《鈔》\n中摘取三、五戒而圖之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以下諸戒，例準此分三："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此中更泛明盜相，文云\n\n「了論中」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「佛不聽者」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「若施主」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「言別乞者」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「若別請人應令作法」是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「若施主別請僧次四人」\n以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「善見別乞」四句以下\n是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「律中不犯開七緣」以下\n是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋中云「正受食法」。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初序，次釋。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「今分二教攝法分\n齊」者是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「就前止持對二教中」\n以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "「可懺」以下。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一事二法。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故文云「不可學法迷亦有九句如前\n段後九句說之」者是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「若對事明，亦有兩個九句，謂可學\n\n迷及不可迷」等是也。準此更應列八句，云：亦有兩個八\n句，謂可學迷、不可學迷等，但是略也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「若無七緣並至果」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「何者後方便」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「五句如此所以多少」等是，"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「若唯據本境犯之有無者」\n下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有理事二別。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「有斯諸異，故立兩儀」是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「律中應教乞言」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云「正立懺儀」。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「次明與法行\n□」。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「上座如前作法」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「彼得羯磨」已下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「羯磨者如前作法」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「與出罪已」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三品分別。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三品分別。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云「正加法」。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "「答言爾」。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乞法指同前，餘者自\n六："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「上來三懺」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略依三戒明。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指如前第四門。文云「長\n染之文如上已明」者是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「律云：若大眾多難集」\n以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「律云：應問彼言」\n以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「問先懺根本」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「今立律論二種懺」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「若獨頭吉羅」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「言衣體者」是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「《十誦》云：若比丘」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「又債息異處」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三階處決："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文中隱，應分三："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「先問僧中誰知」下\n是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「先作賞勞」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「次分輕物律令白二」\n下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「若外界不集者」\n是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「如是總計大數」下\n是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無序。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、時藥　二、非時　三、七日　四、盡形"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序，房舍眾具等附明之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此門入聽門攝。文云「餘有養生，具入聽攝，自如後\n列」也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「聽教中既曰眾具，故雜列之也。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序，造立像寺法附。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「《四分》十種非威儀不應禮」\n是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「《五分》：若請處外客，比丘不得\n入」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此門前鈔文自顯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「《僧祇》云：當留比座坐處行食人\n\n過」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「《四分》云：得食便食為俗譏\n責」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「《僧祇》：食時應護左手」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「必若無人者」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「次受法者，《智論》云」以\n下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「願持是布薩福報」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「《僧祇》：佛告比丘」以下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「餘更略出」下是。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序，四儀法附。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無序。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無序。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文云「以外受法問難戒體」\n等是也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0101001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0101001", "type": "orig", "text": "「相」，底本殘破不清，據《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》第40卷第1頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0102001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0102001", "type": "orig", "text": "「相」，底本殘，據下文及《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》第40卷第1頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0102002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0102002", "type": "orig", "text": "「名」，底本作「來」，據《行事鈔》改，見《大正藏》第40卷第1頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0102003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0102003", "type": "orig", "text": "「訃」，《行事鈔》作「計」，見《大正藏》第40卷第1頁下。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0102004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0102004", "type": "orig", "text": "「徵」，底本作「微」，據《行事鈔》改，見《大正藏》第40卷第2頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0103001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0103001", "type": "orig", "text": "「制」，《行事鈔》作「判」，見《大正藏》第40卷第2頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0103002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0103002", "type": "orig", "text": "「文」，《行事鈔》作「經」，見《大正藏》第40卷第3頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104001", "type": "orig", "text": "「成」，底本作「誠」，據《行事鈔》改，見《大正藏》第40卷第4頁下。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104002", "type": "orig", "text": "「乘經」，底本殘，據《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》40卷4頁下。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104003", "type": "orig", "text": "「論」，底本殘，據《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》40卷4頁下。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104004", "type": "orig", "text": "「經」，底本殘，據《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》40卷5頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104005", "type": "orig", "text": "「論」，底本殘，據《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》第40卷第5頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104006", "type": "orig", "text": "「教」，底本作「門」，據《行事鈔》改，見《大正藏》第40卷第5頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0105001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0105001", "type": "orig", "text": "「約律本」，底本殘，據《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》40卷5頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0105002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0105002", "type": "orig", "text": "「律論」，底本殘，據《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》40卷5頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0105003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0105003", "type": "orig", "text": "「集」，底本殘，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0105004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0105004", "type": "orig", "text": "「分齊」，底本殘，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0105005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0105005", "type": "orig", "text": "「分齊」，底本殘，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0105006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0105006", "type": "orig", "text": "「分別」，底本殘，據《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》40卷7頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0105007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0105007", "type": "orig", "text": "「難」，底本殘，據《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》40卷7頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0106001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0106001", "type": "orig", "text": "「足數眾相」，底本殘，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0106002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0106002", "type": "orig", "text": "「數」，底本無，據《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》第40卷第8頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0106003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0106003", "type": "orig", "text": "「就中相隱難知者」，見《大正藏》第40卷第8頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0106004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0106004", "type": "orig", "text": "「闕」，《行事鈔》作「礙」，見《大正藏》第40卷第8頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0106005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0106005", "type": "orig", "text": "「眾取威儀，不用心順」，《行事鈔》作「眾取威儀相同，不用心順」，見《大正藏》第40卷第9頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0106006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0106006", "type": "orig", "text": "「儀」，底本殘，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0107001", "type": "orig", "text": "「門」，底本殘，據殘存字形擬補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0107002", "type": "orig", "text": "「受」，底本殘，據上文補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0108001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0108001", "type": "orig", "text": "「端」，《行事鈔》作「宗」，見《大正藏》第40卷第11頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0108002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0108002", "type": "orig", "text": "「僧」，底本無，據《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》第40卷第11頁下。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0109001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0109001", "type": "orig", "text": "「上明攝法分齊，即須明非相」，見《大正藏》第40卷第12頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0109002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0109002", "type": "orig", "text": "「受」，底本殘，據《行事鈔》補，見《大正藏》40卷12頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0109003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0109003", "type": "orig", "text": "「界」，底本殘，據文意補。「二約自恣小界」，《行事鈔》作「二因難事自恣」，見《大正藏》40卷12頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0109004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0109004", "type": "orig", "text": "「界」，底本殘，據文意補。「三約說戒小界」，《行事鈔》作「數人說界」，見《大正藏》40卷12頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0110001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0110001", "type": "orig", "text": "「結」，底本殘，據文意補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0111001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0111001", "type": "orig", "text": "「今明結法」，見《大正藏》第40卷第16頁中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0111002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0111002", "type": "orig", "text": "「羯磨者言」，見《大正藏》第40卷第16頁下。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0112001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0112001", "type": "orig", "text": "「上座如常」，見《大正藏》第40卷第17頁上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0112002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0112002", "type": "orig", "text": "「綱」，底本作「網」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0113001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0113001", "type": "orig", "text": "「辨」，底本作「弁」，據文意改。"}
